{"4131750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Honor Mice", "steam_appid": 4131750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Honor Mice</strong> is a hand-crafted 2D action platformer set in a sun-soaked mediterranean fantasy world.<br>When a mysterious figure steals his magic grape, our crimsom rodent embarks on a journey across several distinct worlds to reclaim it. During his honorable quest he will  uncover ancient secrets, battle eccentric creatures, and discover what his true destiny is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, slash, and shoot through vibrant levels filled with echynoderm lifeforms, ancient architecture, and echoes of forgotten civilizations. Throughout your journey, talk to the inhabitants of Arriate to discover their secrets, advice or current gossips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With classic platforming gameplay inspired by the 16-bit era, <strong>Honor Mice</strong> blends swordplay, flintlock combat, and exploration into a colorful retro trip.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Honor Mice</strong> is a hand-crafted 2D action platformer set in a sun-soaked mediterranean fantasy world.<br>When a mysterious figure steals his magic grape, our crimsom rodent embarks on a journey across several distinct worlds to reclaim it. During his honorable quest he will  uncover ancient secrets, battle eccentric creatures, and discover what his true destiny is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, slash, and shoot through vibrant levels filled with echynoderm lifeforms, ancient architecture, and echoes of forgotten civilizations. Throughout your journey, talk to the inhabitants of Arriate to discover their secrets, advice or current gossips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With classic platforming gameplay inspired by the 16-bit era, <strong>Honor Mice</strong> blends swordplay, flintlock combat, and exploration into a colorful retro trip.</p>", "short_description